{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>42歲加拿大搖滾天后Avril Lavigne社交網站久未更新，上一次更新已是上年10月，昨日（13日）卻無預警宣布榮升母親，誕下首胎，爆粗表示：「我哋嘅迷你XX公主嚟到啦！」她上載3張黑白照，其中她抱住B女、握住B女小手、與滑板上放上三對鞋，分別是男裝、女裝與童裝，不過未有公開B女生父身份。Avril發言人表示：「Avril最近享受家庭生活，同時製作新大碟，她想多謝粉絲一直的愛戴！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:38:20.843408+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:45:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T02:51:34.060870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:31:25.822906+00:00","content_hash":"9fa85d3c8a22f290b9880e1ce2fe491299d767879a23bbe05186833c07b289dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:38:20.843408+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}